# Keys of the hysteria2 outbound that a profile's extra may set, sing-box 1.14.x (design.md, "Validation").
# Not here: what the generator sets (server, ports, password, up/down_mbps, obfs, tls.server_name, tls.alpn,
# tls.insecure, bind_interface), file paths, detour, and anything outside the outbound.
network
connect_timeout
udp_fragment
tls
tls.disable_sni
tls.min_version
tls.max_version
tls.cipher_suites
tls.curve_preferences
tls.certificate
tls.certificate_public_key_sha256
tls.fragment
tls.fragment_fallback_delay
tls.record_fragment
